                      "content": "1334. Find the City With the Smallest Number of Neighbors",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "DM1Vi",
                      "name": "editorText",
                      "fill": "#E5E7EB",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "# 1334. Find the City With the Smallest Number of Neighbors\n\n## Reflection\nThis problem requires **all-pairs shortest path**. I realized it should use `Floyd-Warshall`. I was not familiar with this pattern and need more practice.\n\n## Mistake\nI focused on running Dijkstra from each city and did not step back to recognize the all-pairs shape.\n\n## Review Action\n- Practice 2 more shortest path problems\n- Keep the decision guide concise\n- Only update the review map if the rule is missing\n\n## Links\n[[Shortest Path Decision Guide]]\n[[Floyd-Warshall]]",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
